[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0003","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0006","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Winsock 互斥体拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 操作系统的 Winsock2ProtocolCatalogMutex 互斥体对象因权限配置不当而存在安全漏洞，该互斥体被赋予了 Everyone 组的完全控制权限。具有本地登录权限的低权限攻击者可将该互斥体的权限修改为 \"No Access\"，从而阻止 Winsock 网络服务正常工作，导致系统网络连接完全中断并引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及其所有后续补丁版本，攻击者需具备本地交互式登录权限方可利用此漏洞。漏洞利用条件简单，攻击者只需通过修改互斥体访问控制列表即可禁用系统的网络通信能力。根据 CVSS 3.1 评分体系，该漏洞评分为 7.1（高危），本地攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，对系统可用性和完整性造成严重影响。Microsoft 已发布 MS01-011 安全公告及对应补丁程序修复此权限配置问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0006"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-003 补丁（KB279336），升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 7 或安装对应安全更新程序，修复 Winsock2ProtocolCatalogMutex 的访问权限配置。如无法立即安装补丁，应在服务器安全策略中撤销未授权用户的交互式登录权限，限制本地登录账户范围，仅允许管理员和系统账户访问该互斥体，以阻止本地用户修改对象权限导致网络连接中断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98075221915234&w=2","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-003","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2001/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0006","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2001/CVE-2001-0006.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0006.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0605","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0083","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1 内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Media Services 4.0 和 4.1 中的 Windows Media Unicast Service（单播服务）在处理特定类型连接关闭时未能正确释放已分配的内存资源，导致内存泄漏。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送大量被截断的连接请求，逐步耗尽系统可用内存，最终造成 Windows Media 服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞被微软命名为\"Severed Windows Media Server Connection\"漏洞，影响运行 Windows Media Services 4.0 和 4.1 的服务器系统，CVSS v2.0 评分为 5.0，危害等级中危。微软已在安全公告 MS00-097 中发布修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0083"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-02-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-097 提供的补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=C5892A8F-F300-4DBA-8A44-1ADFD78EE177）。Windows Media Services 4.1（Windows 2000）用户可将系统升级至 Windows 2000 SP3 及以上版本，该修复已包含在 SP3 中。Windows Media Services 4.0 用户需单独安装对应补丁。临时缓解措施：在无法打补丁时，可在防火墙上限制对 Windows Media Unicast Service 端口（通常为 TCP 1755）的访问，仅允许可信来源连接；如服务因攻击耗尽资源，可重启 Windows Media Unicast Service 恢复服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0083","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2001/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0083.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0083.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0083.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0097","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0097","title":"Infinite Interchange 3.6.1 Web界面拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Infinite Interchange 3.6.1的Web接口存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份验证即可通过发送超大的POST请求导致应用程序崩溃，造成服务不可用。攻击复杂度低，影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0097"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Infinite Interchange 3.6.1已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件。若无法替换，可在前端反向代理或Web服务器层面限制POST请求体大小以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T16:52:57Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2140","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152403","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5798"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0036","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0087","title":"itetris itetris 1.6.1/1.6.2 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Itetris（智能俄罗斯方块）1.6.2及更早版本的 svgalib 版由于以 setuid root 权限安装，且程序在解压字体文件时通过 system() 函数调用 gunzip，但未指定 gunzip 的绝对路径，而是信任 PATH 环境变量来定位可执行文件。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将其指向包含恶意 gunzip 程序的目录（如 /tmp），随后运行 itetris 并传入特制的 .gz 字体文件路径触发解压操作，导致恶意程序以 root 权限执行，从而获取系统完全控制权。该漏洞影响 Linux 系统上安装了 itetris 的所有环境，攻击者无需任何特权即可利用，已存在公开的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0087"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-02-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载 itetris 软件包（如已不再使用），或移除 itetris 二进制文件的 setuid root 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/local/bin/itetris`。如必须使用，可升级至官方修复版本，或通过修改源码将 gunzip 调用改为绝对路径 `/bin/gunzip` 以消除 PATH 环境变量注入风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0087","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2001/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0087.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0087.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0392","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1274","title":"MySQL 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.23.31 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 MySQL 服务发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝服务，并可能利用该漏洞提升权限。该漏洞影响 MySQL 3.22.x 及 3.23.x 系列版本，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，可对目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性造成部分影响。厂商已发布 3.23.31 版本修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1274"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 3.23.31 或更高版本，该版本修复了本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，限制 MySQL 服务的本地用户访问权限，避免向不可信用户开放本地数据库访问。同时监控系统日志中异常的 MySQL 崩溃或提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000375","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98089552030459&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-006.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-013","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-014.php3","http://www.mysql.com/documentation/mysql/bychapter/manual_News.html#News-3.23.3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-003.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1274.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1274","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1274.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1274.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-013.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4pvx-qg9w-9qv5/GHSA-4pvx-qg9w-9qv5.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1274.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1274.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mysql_3_23_31.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86999/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0392.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0392.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0394","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1275","title":"MySQL 数据库 特权提升漏洞","description":"MySQL数据库在3.23.31版本之前存在特权提升漏洞，已有MySQL账户的用户可通过执行SHOW GRANTS命令，从mysql.user表中获取加密的管理员密码，随后通过密码破解手段获取更高权限。该漏洞影响MySQL 3.23.31之前的所有版本，攻击条件为攻击者需先拥有MySQL账户登录权限，利用方式为通过SHOW GRANTS命令提取密码哈希并进行破解以提升权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1275"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:56Z","remediation":"将 MySQL 升级至 3.23.31 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SHOW GRANTS 命令泄露 mysql.user 表中加密管理员密码的问题。同时建议限制普通用户对 mysql.user 表的直接访问权限，移除不必要用户的 SHOW GRANTS 授权，并定期轮换数据库管理员密码以降低密码被破解的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98089552030459&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-006.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-014.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-003.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b2be8fd4334c936c67f124199efee5b6ef5d0a06/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1275.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1275","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c671d2fb006282d170beae8bd280660988f3dd1d/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1275.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4190a549751bffc11b00246a033a062f4109e196/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1275.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jr9h-ffpv-wrqm/GHSA-jr9h-ffpv-wrqm.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1275.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mysql_flaws.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88032/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1275.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0002","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1473","title":"SSH SSH-1协议中间人攻击漏洞","description":"SSH-1 协议存在中间人攻击漏洞，远程攻击者可创建与目标服务器相同的会话 ID，但使用弱公钥对替代目标服务器的强公钥，从而计算出对应的私钥，利用被攻陷的密钥对伪装成目标服务器，实现对客户端质询响应的重放攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用 SSH-1 协议的服务端与客户端，攻击者需处于客户端与服务器之间的网络路径上，无需认证即可实施攻击，可导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等严重后果。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1473"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:20Z","remediation":"禁用 SSH-1 协议，升级至仅支持 SSH-2 的 OpenSSH 版本（如 OpenSSH 3.0+），在 sshd_config 中设置 Protocol 2 并重启 sshd 服务。对于无法升级的旧系统，在服务器和客户端两端均配置只接受 SSH-2 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/684820","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6603","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2001/CVE-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1473.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1473.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2001-1473-1298.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2001-1473_1.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2001/CVE-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2001-1473_4.yaml","https://github.com/cyb3r-w0lf/nuclei-template-collection/blob/7025ebe04ab60b84aee0af1ecf4f90601332e8e7/nuclei-templates/CVE-2001/cve-2001-1473.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6442cc5e7200c513b7657ab6312f5f41cffcced0/2001/CVE-2001-1473.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/e08815527662784ab03e5fd602b4609aa8ded510/data/2001/CVE-2001-1473-alexandermoro_cve-2001-1473.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0503","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1385","title":"PHP Apache模块 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"PHP 4.0.0 至 4.0.4 版本中 Apache 模块存在配置隔离缺陷，当管理员为某个虚拟主机设置 `engine = off` 禁用 PHP 引擎时，该配置可能错误地影响同一 Apache 实例上的其他虚拟主机，导致其他虚拟主机的 PHP 解析功能被意外禁用。攻击者可通过向受影响的虚拟主机发送请求，使 Apache 直接返回 PHP 脚本的源代码而非执行结果，从而泄露敏感信息（如数据库凭据、业务逻辑等）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，主要影响共享主机环境。官方建议升级至 PHP 4.0.5 或更高版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1385"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:10Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 4.0.5 或更高版本（如 4.0.6、4.1.0 等），在 httpd.conf 中为每个虚拟主机单独配置 php_admin_flag engine on/off 而非全局 engine off，或使用 php.ini 中的 open_basedir 限制脚本访问路径作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000373","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97957961212852","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-020","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5939.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-013.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-136.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2205","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1385","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1385.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1385.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rrg-mmq3-p43v/GHSA-3rrg-mmq3-p43v.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1385.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1385.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-020.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7c9b61a5-8066-444c-b5b8-78ed5b9e2c21.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0503.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0443","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0443.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1044","title":"Basilix Webmail 0.9.7 文件权限配置不当漏洞","description":"Basilix Webmail 0.9.7beta 及可能其他版本存在不正确的文件权限漏洞，将 .class 和 .inc 文件存放在 Web 文档根目录下且未限制访问权限，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接通过 HTTP 请求访问 mysql.class 等敏感文件，从中窃取 MySQL 数据库的用户名和密码等配置信息，导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1044"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:28Z","remediation":"将 `mysql.class` 等敏感文件移出 Web 根目录（document root），或配置 Web 服务器（如 Apache）通过 `.htaccess` 或虚拟主机规则禁止访问 `*.class` 和 `*.inc` 文件，例如添加 `<FilesMatch \"\\.(class|inc)$\"> Require all denied </FilesMatch>`。同时升级到 Basilix Webmail 最新版本或迁移至其他受支持的邮件客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155897","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2198","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5934","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20538","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1044","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1044.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1044.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-43r6-r8w4-qp6c/GHSA-43r6-r8w4-qp6c.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/basilix_inc_files.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2198/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1044.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--06dd4b58-34a6-4a8a-a269-2f0128866904.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0443.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0443.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0443.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0906","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0162","title":"Microsoft Windows CE TCP 初始序列号预测漏洞","description":"Windows CE 3.0.9348 版本使用的 TCP 初始序列号（ISN）生成算法可被预测，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞实施 TCP 连接欺骗或劫持。通过预测目标主机的 ISN 值，攻击者能够伪造合法 TCP 连接，进而截获、篡改或注入网络流量，造成数据泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响运行 Windows CE 3.0.9348 的设备，攻击者只需与目标在同一网络可达范围内即可发起攻击。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0162"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"建议将 WinCE 3.0 升级至 4.0 或更高版本以修复 TCP 序列号生成算法。对于无法升级的遗留设备，应在网络边界部署防火墙或 IDS 监控异常 TCP 握手，或通过 ACL 严格限制可访问该设备的源 IP 地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cs.jhu.edu/~seny/pubs/wince802.pdf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0162","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fb434b2032246212419d81952c5a487d58bc8ffa/2001/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0162.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0162.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2001/CVE-2001-0162.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0646","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0646.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0163","title":"Cisco Aironet AP340 TCP序列号可预测漏洞","description":"Cisco Aironet AP340 无线接入点基站在建立 TCP 连接时生成的初始序列号（ISN）可被预测，导致远程攻击者能够伪造或劫持已建立的 TCP 会话。该漏洞影响使用 Cisco AP340 系列无线基站的网络环境，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用可预测的 ISN 发起 TCP 会话劫持攻击，进而截获敏感数据、注入恶意流量或中断合法通信。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级为中等。Cisco 已通过固件更新修复了 ISN 随机化问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0163"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 Cisco Aironet AP340 固件至支持随机 TCP 初始化序列号生成的版本（如 v12.5 或更高版本）。如无法立即更新，可通过配置设备禁用易受攻击的 TCP 连接模式，或在网络边界部署 IPsec 隧道以保护流经 AP340 的所有 TCP 会话流量，从源头防止序列号预测攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cs.jhu.edu/~seny/pubs/wince802.pdf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0163","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0163.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2001/CVE-2001-0163.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0163.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0646.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0645","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0645.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0161","title":"Cisco 340系列 Aironet WEP加密弱随机数漏洞","description":"Cisco 340-series Aironet 无线接入点固件 11.01 存在 WEP 加密实现缺陷，其在 WEP 加密过程中未使用 24 个可用 IV（初始化向量）位中的 6 个，导致 IV 密钥空间被大幅缩小，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过被动捕获或主动注入数据包的方式进行暴力破解，大幅降低破解 WEP 密钥的计算成本。该漏洞影响 Cisco 340-series Aironet 系列接入点，远程攻击者成功利用后可窃取无线网络中的敏感传输数据。CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0161"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"将 Cisco 340-series Aironet 接入点固件从存在漏洞的 11.01 版本升级至 Cisco 发布的安全修复版本，升级后的固件将完整使用全部 24 位 IV（初始化向量）进行 WEP 加密，消除因仅使用 18 位 IV 导致的密钥空间缩减问题，使暴力破解攻击无法有效实施。升级前请先从 Cisco 官方支持站点下载对应硬件型号的补丁固件，按照 Cisco 文档完成固件刷新操作。如因业务原因暂无法升级固件，建议临时将接入点配置为仅接受已注册 MAC 地址的客户端关联，并通过 VLAN 隔离无线接入段，以限制未授权攻击者的接入范围。鉴于 WEP 协议本身存在已知设计缺陷，长期最佳实践是逐步将无线网络迁移至 WPA2-Enterprise 或 WPA3 加密方案，彻底消除 WEP 相关的安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cs.jhu.edu/~seny/pubs/wince802.pdf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0161","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b84ffe2a6a36d65b7abc48d8adad1e8aeabb391/2001/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0161.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0161.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2001/CVE-2001-0161.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0645.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0644","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0644.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0160","title":"Lucent ORiNOCO WaveLAN 无线网卡 WEP加密初始化向量可预测漏洞","description":"Lucent/ORiNOCO WaveLAN 无线网卡在实现无线加密协议（WEP）时，使用了可预测的初始化向量（IV）值。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在目标无线网络覆盖范围内，通过被动监听并收集足够数量的无线数据包，快速获取大量 IV 值。利用这些可预测的 IV 值，攻击者能够通过统计分析或字典攻击方式，在较短时间内破解 WEP 加密密钥，进而解密网络中传输的敏感数据。该漏洞影响了所有使用 Lucent/ORiNOCO WaveLAN 系列网卡的无线设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0160"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"建议立即更换支持 WPA2 或 WPA3 的无线网卡，并更新无线路由器固件至最新版本。禁用 WEP 协议，配置强加密密码（推荐使用 AES 加密）。如无法立即更换硬件，可在防火墙层面禁用 affected 端口，并部署网络入侵检测系统监控异常的 IV 模式。此外，建议限制无线网络的物理覆盖范围，开启 MAC 地址过滤，部署无线网络专用 VLAN，必要时配置临时缓解措施如定期更换 WEP 密钥。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cs.jhu.edu/~seny/pubs/wince802.pdf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0160","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/881dc8aad9cc7f4353e5388bbdaaeb83a2e3abe3/2001/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0160.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0160.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0160.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0644.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0250","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0590","title":"Apache Tomcat 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat Servlet 3.2.2 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可发送不带 HTTP 协议规范（如 HTTP/1.0）的畸形 URL 请求，绕过安全限制读取任意 JSP 文件源代码，导致敏感源代码泄露。影响 Apache Tomcat Servlet 3.2.2 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。攻击条件为发送不以 HTTP/1.0 或 HTTP/1.1 结尾的畸形 HTTP 请求，服务器解析异常导致返回 JSP 源码而非执行结果。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0590"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T02:00:18Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0250.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0250.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0289","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0289.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0679","title":"趋势科技 InterScan VirusWall HELO 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"这是一个影响趋势科技 Interscan VirusWall 3.2.3/3.3 版本的安全漏洞。路由器上的 HTTP 服务器在处理来自远程攻击者发送的特制长 HELO 命令时会出现缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码被执行。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络远程触发此漏洞，实现完整的系统控制。漏洞影响具体产品为 Interscan VirusWall 3.2.3/3.3 版本和可能包括 3.23 版本。攻击条件非常宽松，攻击方式简单，攻击者只需向目标服务器发送一个包含超长 HELO 命令的网络数据包即可触发溢出。在成功的利用中，攻击者可以劫持整个服务器进程，实现远程代码执行（CVE 评分为 10.0 是最高的严重性）。由于存在无限循环写入和可疑的文件系统操作，导致应用程序崩溃和拒绝服务风险很高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0679"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-11-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:45Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.6 或更高版本以获取官方安全补丁，或直接停用该过时产品；若暂时无法升级，请在防火墙配置规则阻断外部对默认 SMTP 端口 25 的访问，并将服务绑定至本地回环地址限制仅本地访问以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94204166130782&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94208143007829&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94216491202063&w=2","http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9911&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R2331","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3465","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19614"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0289.toml"}]